"""The mutants of K5's own part (revision 2: two signed modes, one effect each, no wait). Each row: (name, 'op', exact
anchor, replacement). The anchor must occur exactly once in the built source and be a text of op.py (mutate.py check).
One mutant per member of effects_of(), one per refusal of validate_plan and of the precheck of each mode, one per
condition of the settlement of each effect and of the readback. The carried parts are the core's own list."""
MUTANTS=[]
COMBOS={}
REDUNDANT={}
def add(name,old,new):MUTANTS.append((name,'op',old,new))

